## Ready-to-Produce 35-Second Script: Smart Desk Wireless Charger

```text
[0:00 - 0:03] THE HOOK (Visual: Close-up macro peel of protective glass film with crisp ASMR sound)
Voiceover: "If your nightstand currently looks like an electrical hazard, you need to see this."

[0:03 - 0:09] THE CONTRAST (Visual: Messy bedside table with 4 tangled cords plugged into an overloaded wall strip)
Voiceover: "I used to have three different chargers for my phone, watch, and earbuds. It looked terrible and half the time my watch didn't even charge."

[0:09 - 0:20] THE MAGIC DEMO (Visual: Single sleek aluminum pad. Creator sets iPhone on it with a loud magnetic snap, followed by watch and AirPods)
Voiceover: "This 3-in-1 foldable pad replaces all of them with one single hidden cable. The magnets are crazy strong, and it fast-charges everything at the same time."

[0:20 - 0:27] THE TRAVEL USE-CASE (Visual: Folding device flat into the palm of a hand and slipping it into a jacket pocket)
Voiceover: "Plus, it folds completely flat to the size of a wallet so you can toss it straight into your backpack when you travel."

[0:27 - 0:35] THE OFFER & CTA (Visual: Unboxing box, warranty card, and direct finger pointing to the CTA link)
Voiceover: "They're doing a buy-one-get-one 50% off holiday bundle right now with a 30-day money-back guarantee. Tap below to check if they're still in stock."
```

